<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EJS - Motor de Plantilla</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #f0f8ff;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 3rem 4rem;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #c5dff5;
      border-top: 6px solid #3A8FD4;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 90%;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e8f4ff;
      color: #1a5f9e;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: #3A8FD4;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    p.desc {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    code {
      display: block;
      background: #f0f8ff;
      border: 1px solid #b0d5f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #1a5f9e;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    a {
      color: #3A8FD4;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="badge">⚙️ Motor: <%= motor %></span>
    <h1><%= mensaje %></h1>
    <p class="desc">
      Este mensaje fue renderizado usando <strong>EJS</strong>
      (Embedded JavaScript), un motor de plantillas que permite incrustar
      código JavaScript directamente en HTML con la etiqueta <em>&lt;% %&gt;</em>.
    </p>
    <code>&lt;h1&gt;&lt;%= mensaje %&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</code>
    <a href="/">← Volver al inicio</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
